                                "sense_id": "dcfe5cae-1fff-37a2-830c-694ec2aa9951",
                                "text": "His sword fell from his grasp—his eye, late glaring with the ire of a stricken tiger,—his brow, late speaking but death, and dark defiance, suddenly sank into the soft beseeming of gratefulness, and of betokened kindness and feeling."
